    {
      "language": "en",
      "status": "official",
      "text": "section 7702B(d)(4)-(5): the dollar amount per day in the per diem limitation ($175 per day, or the equivalent amount on another periodic basis), increased for calendar years after 1997 at the same time and in the same manner as amounts are increased under section 213(d)(10). Calendar years 1998-2024 are gaps (their Revenue Procedures are not pinned): MISSING_PARAMETER_VALUE, not a figure without a pinned source (TECH-GAPS G3503)."
